{"4385440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bullet Spell", "steam_appid": 4385440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/2eb9b6e228617f950ead94d76c8ce53f.avif?t=1787204120\" alt=\"About\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras_big/2eb9b6e228617f950ead94d76c8ce53f.webp?t=1787204120 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Spell is a stage based Shoot 'Em Up with Bullet Hell bosses where you control two characters simultaneously (or with a friend if that's too challenging). You will take on the role of the twin sisters Aurora and Solana as they are forced into a new career in spy-craft because they acquired the ability to transform and use magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/9d39a4a11fe1f6090a08a4391d2d05cc.poster.avif?t=1787204120\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/9d39a4a11fe1f6090a08a4391d2d05cc.webm?t=1787204120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/9d39a4a11fe1f6090a08a4391d2d05cc.mp4?t=1787204120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/63754a45cee2f81d54689a2f380b9b38.avif?t=1787204120\" alt=\"Two Characters\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras_big/63754a45cee2f81d54689a2f380b9b38.webp?t=1787204120 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Aurora with your left hand and Solana with your right hand, or share controls with a friend in local play or using Steam's Remote Play Together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/917bae05aba8d486c18c88ecc5f9b887.avif?t=1787204120\" alt=\"Rewind\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras_big/917bae05aba8d486c18c88ecc5f9b887.webp?t=1787204120 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Aurora or Solana are defeated time rewinds to whatever point you choose! Rewinding time allows you to succeed when you get stuck. Be careful, the more time you rewind the more it will drastically reduce your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/7d701ff43fbdaa829f0d29b2a87925a4.poster.avif?t=1787204120\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/7d701ff43fbdaa829f0d29b2a87925a4.webm?t=1787204120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/7d701ff43fbdaa829f0d29b2a87925a4.mp4?t=1787204120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/f4e600dd40e8fdbed9e9a424ec21e81d.avif?t=1787204120\" alt=\"Learning\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras_big/f4e600dd40e8fdbed9e9a424ec21e81d.webp?t=1787204120 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorials offer instruction on how to improve at the game. When you've completed the campaign you can use the tips to earn higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Register any point in a mission to practice from and improve at missions that prove challenging for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and rewatch replays to learn from past mistakes or even other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/3ebd3458818437e9ba03079d7b4bb9b7.avif?t=1787204120\" alt=\"Features\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras_big/3ebd3458818437e9ba03079d7b4bb9b7.webp?t=1787204120 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique single-player experience with seamless drop in/out 2-player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind on death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in replay saving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn character art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable upgrades for each character, and in-level power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 levels and multiple difficulty settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode and arcade mode for different play preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports play in vertical or horizontal orientations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/7ac1c3b9329bb04e009033f549309a8f.avif?t=1787204120\" alt=\"Image displaying controls. Left hand for Aurora and right hand for Solana.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c