?t=1787204120 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Aurora with your left hand and Solana with your right hand, or share controls with a friend in local play or using Steam's Remote Play Together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/917bae05aba8d486c18c88ecc5f9b887.avif?t=1787204120\" alt=\"Rewind\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras_big/917bae05aba8d486c18c88ecc5f9b887.webp?t=1787204120 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Aurora or Solana are defeated time rewinds to whatever point you choose! Rewinding time allows you to succeed when you get stuck. Be careful, the more time you rewind the more it will drastically reduce your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/7d701ff43fbdaa829f0d29b2a87925a4.poster.avif?t=1787204120\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/7d701ff43fbdaa829f0d29b2a87925a4.webm?t=1787204120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/7d701ff43fbdaa829f0d29b2a87925a4.mp4?t=1787204120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras/f4e600dd40e8fdbed9e9a424ec21e81d.avif?t=1787204120\" alt=\"Learning\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385440/extras_big/f4e600dd40e8fdbed9e9a424ec21e81d.webp?t=1787204120 widt